<title>UK: TABLE - CONSENSUS FORECASTS ON UK COMPANY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CONSENSUS FORECASTS ON UK COMPANY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending August 15 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>TUESDAY, August 12</p>
<p>BOC Group Plc	     Q3  PFT     109.1	 105-112    109.9</p>
<p>General Accident	   H  PFT     287	   218-266	194</p>
<p>Plc				 DIV     12.4	 12.2-12.6    11.4</p>
<p>Smith and Nephew	   H  PFT     80.1	   79-81.5    90.8</p>
<p>Plc				 DIV     2.4	     2.4	 2.29</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, August 13</p>
<p>No major companies reporting</p>
<p>THURSDAY, August 14</p>
<p>Orange Plc	 H  PFT    -85.6	-75/-95     -125.2</p>
<p>			  EPS    -6.35     -5.8/-7.0     -0.13</p>
<p>WPP Group Plc    H  PFT     77.0	 76-78.3	68.1</p>
<p>FRIDAY, August 15</p>
<p>Alliance &amp; Leicester     H  PFT    186.6	179-193	183.0</p>
<p>Plc				 DIV	6.0	6.0-6.7</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
